{"availability":"available","full":"blindpassasjer/gigboy","name":"gigboy","description":"Self-hosted songbook and gig-prep app for bands — ChordPro songs, setlists, press kits, and rehearsal tools. Own your data, no subscriptions.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":21,"forks":3,"created":"2026-04-25T19:33:51Z","updated":"2026-10-04T18:17:52Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["band","chordpro","docker","music","postgresql","presskits","pwa","react","self-hosted","selfhosted","setlist"],"demo":"https://blindpassasjer.github.io/gigboy/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:04.658Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:04.658Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:04.658Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:22:04.658Z","stars":21,"forks":3}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The songbook and gig-prep app for bands who'd rather own their data than rent it.","Live demo · Quick start · Screenshots · Features · Self-hosting guide · License","No subscriptions, no per-seat pricing, no feature paywalls — every account gets full access."],"features":["ChordPro rendering — chords shown inline above lyrics, written as [G]Amazing [C]grace","Transpose — shift every chord up or down by semitone in real time, on stage or in rehearsal;","whatever you set sticks to that song for you next time (the horn player reads in Eb), and each bandmate keeps their own","Live preview while writing — see the rendered sheet as you type","Import from ChordPro, OnSong, and pasted Ultimate Guitar / Chordify / CifraClub charts —"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/blindpassasjer/gigboy/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ae02d5603ee35850309c08d8595b5695463052537fa38e7ad0514b3907b65dca","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:04.980Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:04.980Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The songbook and gig-prep app for bands who'd rather own